"armor-sets\t定制特机\t2 件":"<p class=\"bn\">旧火星外交</p><p>消灭<span class=\"bar-orange\">守护者</span>、<span class=\"bar-orange\">橙血</span>或更高级<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>后收起武器时：<br>恢复 <span class=\"unsure\">40?</span> 点<span class=\"health\">生命值</span>，并使 12 米内的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>迷失；两次触发间具有 <span class=\"unsure\">2?</span> 秒内置冷却。</p>",
